[24.302, "o", "Read the dive at kb/01a04e40-5834-7665-840a-4caa8646cc02.md in full -- its \"## Brief\" section is your brief, and any notes below it are what earlier divers did and left undone.\r\n"]
[24.382, "o", "Read the feat it serves at kb/01a04e40-4eee-796b-8a16-6826b2de64b8.md, and whatever those two link to in their frontmatter.\r\n"]
[24.453, "o", "Then do only the requested work, not more. Commit completed work in every scoped repo that has a work branch. As you progress, use `nosedive append-log.dive` to record what you did, and what you think is next. Do not edit the brief or change any scopes. When done, leave the work in place for the pilot to review. Do not run `nosedive land` unless you have been directly instructed to.\r\n"]
[24.488, "o", "Scratch space for this dive: workspace/.scratch/01a04e40-5834-7665-840a-4caa8646cc02/ Write temp files there, never /tmp. It is local only; pack will not capture it.\r\n"]
